NOTICE ON THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

This package bundles and redistributes no third-party assets.

scripts/fetch-assets.mjs downloads the Minecraft villager sounds and the
villager skin onto the operator's own machine, at the operator's direction,
into a local cache outside this package. Those files are the property of
Mojang Studios / Microsoft and are not covered by the MIT grant above; they
are never part of this package's source tree, tarball, or repository.

